## 7. Ingestion (all client-side)

### 7.1 Documents → `documents.extracted_text`
`file_picker` → TXT (UTF-8), PDF (text layer extraction), DOCX (XML text extraction). Extracted text truncated to a fixed per-document character budget before storage/prompting. Unsupported/failed extraction → inline error, goal remains usable without the doc.

### 7.2 Existing calendars → `busy_blocks`
`file_picker` → parse `VEVENT`s: `DTSTART`/`DTEND` (or `DURATION`), `TZID`/UTC normalization to local device time, `RRULE` expansion across the horizon. All-day events (DATE values) mark the full working window of that day busy. Expanded intervals stored with source filename. Busy blocks are inputs only — the slotter never overlaps them, never edits them.

