## 8. UI / UX

**Onboarding:** opens directly to the agenda on the demo key. No gate, no wizard. Empty-state prompts guide to the first goal.

### 8.1 Screens
1. **Agenda (home)** — today's tasks grouped by goal, ordered by time; per-task quick actions **Done** / **Didn't Start**; "Re-plan" button; adjusted/needs-attention markers; provider-error banner area; offline badge when applicable.
2. **Goals** — list with priority chips, target dates, progress (completed/total); create/edit: title, description, priority (P1–P3), target date, document attach; "Decompose" action per goal.
3. **Settings** — provider config (demo status, BYOK preset/base URL/model/key, inline validation), working hours, buffer minutes, active days, `.ics` import, demo-key exhaustion messaging entry point.
4. **Re-plan result** — new plan summary, moved-task diff, coaching tips.

### 8.2 Degradation matrix

| Capability | Needs provider? |
|---|---|
| Agenda view, task status (Done/Didn't Start) | No |
| Skip re-slot + calendar rewrite | No |
| `.ics` import, document extraction | No |
| Goal CRUD | No |
| Decompose (new goal) | Yes |
| Full re-plan | Yes |

