## 9. Security & Demo-Key Operations

- **The embedded demo key will be extracted.** Treat it as public from day one. Controls: hard monthly spend cap set on the provider dashboard at an amount acceptable to lose entirely; restricted to a single cheap structured-output model; assume strangers will drain it and the §4.4 degradation path is the designed response.
- **Rotation:** key rotation requires either an app release (key compiled in) or a static remote config file (demo mode reads preset/model/key from a versioned static URL — no compute backend, enables rotation without a release). Build-time choice; static remote config recommended.
- BYOK keys live in `flutter_secure_storage` (Keystore-backed), never in SQLite, never logged.
- No telemetry. The only network traffic is provider HTTPS.

