## 10. Performance Targets

- Slotter full re-place of ≤ 100 tasks: < 100 ms on mid-range Android.
- Decompose/re-plan latency: provider-bound (typically 5–30 s); progress indicator, cancellable.
- All local operations instant and offline-capable.

