## 13. Goal Intake Notes

Free-form multi-goal intake (no forced scaffolding): each goal is a short-term target with title, free-text description, explicit priority, and a target date; optional long-term grouping via `parent_goal_id`. Document attachments supply domain context. The prompt's per-day summary plus goal priorities is what makes decomposition quality survive the unstructured intake.

